# PHPStan

- The project uses PHPStan level 8 with Larastan (`phpstan.neon`).
- Fix new type errors. Do not add lines to `phpstan-baseline.neon` to hide them.
- After `app/` edits, run `vendor/bin/phpstan analyse` and resolve failures before finishing.
- Add precise param, return, and array shapes when the analyser cannot infer them.
